div begin="00:00.961" end="03:59.132"><p begin="00:00.961" end="00:04.152" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.961" end="00:01.639">高嶺</span><span begin="00:01.639" end="00:02.064">の</span><span begin="00:02.064" end="00:02.937">花</span><span begin="00:02.937" end="00:03.123">の</span><span begin="00:03.123" end="00:03.408">あ</span><span begin="00:03.408" end="00:03.696">な</span><span begin="00:03.696" end="00:04.152">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你犹如高岭之花</span></p><p begin="00:04.379" end="00:05.064" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:04.379" end="00:04.600">だ</span><span begin="00:04.600" end="00:04.836">か</span><span begin="00:04.836" end="00:05.064">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我这种存在</span></p><p begin="00:05.064" end="00:07.406" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:05.064" end="00:05.808">私</span><span begin="00:05.808" end="00:06.275">な</span><span begin="00:06.275" end="00:07.406">んて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于我而言</span></p><p begin="00:07.632" end="00:09.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:07.632" end="00:08.033">釣り</span><span begin="00:08.033" end="00:08.248">合</span><span begin="00:08.248" end="00:08.427">う</span><span begin="00:08.427" end="00:08.755">わけ</span><span begin="00:08.755" end="00:09.452">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">肯定配不上你吧</span></p><p begin="00:09.677" end="00:11.468" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:09.677" end="00:10.035">って</span><span begin="00:10.035" end="00:10.300">思</span><span begin="00:10.300" end="00:10.491">う</span><span begin="00:10.491" end="00:10.633">け</span><span begin="00:10.633" end="00:11.468">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我虽此般念想</span></p><p begin="00:12.034" end="00:16.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:12.034" end="00:12.433">だ</span><span begin="00:12.433" end="00:12.825">けど</span><span begin="00:12.825" end="00:13.096">手</span><span begin="00:13.096" end="00:13.784">放し</span><span begin="00:13.784" end="00:14.329">たく</span><span begin="00:14.478" end="00:15.053">ない</span><span begin="00:15.053" end="00:15.441">の</span><span begin="00:15.441" end="00:16.191">です</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可我也不愿放手</span></p><p begin="00:16.421" end="00:23.218" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:16.421" end="00:16.705">シ</span><span begin="00:16.705" end="00:17.073">ン</span><span begin="00:17.073" end="00:17.715">デレ</span><span begin="00:17.715" end="00:18.231">ラ</span><span begin="00:18.231" end="00:19.035">ストー</span><span begin="00:19.035" end="00:19.558">リー</span><span begin="00:19.558" end="00:20.069">は</span><span begin="00:20.272" end="00:20.604">本</span><span begin="00:20.604" end="00:21.020">当</span><span begin="00:21.020" end="00:21.153">に</span><span begin="00:21.153" end="00:21.670">あり</span><span begin="00:21.670" end="00:22.134">ます</span><span begin="00:22.134" end="00:23.218">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">灰姑娘的故事</span></p><p begin="00:24.080" end="00:25.479" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:24.080" end="00:24.546">この</span><span begin="00:24.546" end="00:25.013">幸</span><span begin="00:25.013" end="00:25.479">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能够相信这份幸福吗？</span></p><p begin="00:25.479" end="00:27.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:25.479" end="00:25.883">信</span><span begin="00:25.883" end="00:26.286">じ</span><span begin="00:26.286" end="00:26.635">て</span><span begin="00:26.635" end="00:27.093">いい</span><span begin="00:27.093" end="00:27.497">です</span><span begin="00:27.497" end="00:27.900">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是否可以坚信嘛</span></p><p begin="00:28.314" end="00:31.379" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:28.314" end="00:28.752">好き</span><span begin="00:28.752" end="00:29.190">で</span><span begin="00:29.190" end="00:29.561">いて</span><span begin="00:29.561" end="00:29.882">も</span><span begin="00:29.882" end="00:30.223">いい</span><span begin="00:30.223" end="00:30.941">です</span><span begin="00:30.941" end="00:31.379">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢上你也可以吗？</span></p><p begin="00:31.939" end="00:36.352" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:31.939" end="00:32.822">泡</span><span begin="00:32.822" end="00:33.704">沫</span><span begin="00:33.704" end="00:34.087">の</span><span begin="00:34.087" end="00:34.802">夢</span><span begin="00:34.802" end="00:35.275">で</span><span begin="00:35.275" end="00:36.352">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使只是泡影一梦</span></p><p begin="00:39.674" end="00:47.776" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:39.674" end="00:40.011">あ</span><span begin="00:40.011" end="00:40.831">なた</span><span begin="00:40.831" end="00:41.510">に</span><span begin="00:41.510" end="00:41.989">出</span><span begin="00:41.989" end="00:42.568">会う</span><span begin="00:42.568" end="00:43.146">まで</span><span begin="00:43.146" end="00:43.447">は</span><span begin="00:43.447" end="00:44.304">諦</span><span begin="00:44.304" end="00:44.882">めて</span><span begin="00:44.882" end="00:45.461">ただ</span><span begin="00:45.461" end="00:46.040">目を</span><span begin="00:46.040" end="00:46.541">閉じ</span><span begin="00:46.541" end="00:46.976">て</span><span begin="00:46.976" end="00:47.776">いた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我放弃挣扎 阖上双眼</span></p><p begin="00:48.041" end="00:49.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:48.041" end="00:48.423">惹</span><span begin="00:48.423" end="00:48.826">か</span><span begin="00:48.826" end="00:49.055">れ</span><span begin="00:49.055" end="00:49.741">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你倾心</span></p><p begin="00:49.741" end="00:50.968" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:49.741" end="00:50.456">初</span><span begin="00:50.456" end="00:50.559">め</span><span begin="00:50.559" end="00:50.968">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我第一次许下心愿</span></p><p begin="00:50.968" end="00:54.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:50.968" end="00:51.666">望</span><span begin="00:51.666" end="00:52.293">んで</span><span begin="00:52.293" end="00:52.862">し</span><span begin="00:52.862" end="00:53.062">ま</span><span begin="00:53.062" end="00:53.760">った</span><span begin="00:53.760" end="00:54.458">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断期望能够拥有</span></p><p begin="00:54.820" end="01:02.419" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:54.820" end="00:55.186">あ</span><span begin="00:55.186" end="00:55.597">なた</span><span begin="00:55.597" end="00:56.590">との</span><span begin="00:57.785" end="00:58.357">幸</span><span begin="00:58.357" end="00:58.762">せ</span><span begin="00:58.762" end="01:02.419">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祈愿与你的幸福</span></p><p begin="01:02.621" end="01:08.872" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:02.621" end="01:03.607">ず</span><span begin="01:03.607" end="01:04.010">っと</span><span begin="01:04.010" end="01:04.705">ここ</span><span begin="01:04.705" end="01:05.399">に</span><span begin="01:05.399" end="01:06.028">い</span><span begin="01:06.028" end="01:06.327">ても</span><span begin="01:06.327" end="01:07.219">いい</span><span begin="01:07.219" end="01:08.177">です</span><span begin="01:08.177" end="01:08.872">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可以一直陪伴在你身边吗？</span></p><p begin="01:09.181" end="01:14.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:09.181" end="01:09.428">あ</span><span begin="01:09.428" end="01:09.952">なた</span><span begin="01:09.952" end="01:10.335">の</span><span begin="01:10.335" end="01:10.884">そ</span><span begin="01:10.884" end="01:11.702">ばに</span><span begin="01:11.702" end="01:12.173">居</span><span begin="01:12.173" end="01:13.030">たい</span><span begin="01:13.030" end="01:13.779">の</span><span begin="01:13.779" end="01:14.739">です</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想留在你身边</span></p><p begin="01:18.018" end="01:24.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:18.018" end="01:18.486">あ</span><span begin="01:18.486" end="01:19.031">な</span><span begin="01:19.031" end="01:19.575">た</span><span begin="01:19.575" end="01:20.032">の</span><span begin="01:20.032" end="01:20.882">隣</span><span begin="01:20.882" end="01:21.455">は</span><span begin="01:21.455" end="01:22.028">私</span><span begin="01:22.028" end="01:22.651">で</span><span begin="01:22.651" end="01:23.173">いい</span><span begin="01:23.173" end="01:23.746">です</span><span begin="01:23.746" end="01:24.319">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你身边的人是我也没关系吗？</span></p><p begin="01:24.579" end="01:29.688" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:24.579" end="01:25.079">他</span><span begin="01:25.079" end="01:25.546">の</span><span begin="01:25.546" end="01:26.091">誰</span><span begin="01:26.091" end="01:27.085">にも</span><span begin="01:27.085" end="01:27.651">譲り</span><span begin="01:27.651" end="01:28.411">たく</span><span begin="01:28.411" end="01:29.049">ない</span><span begin="01:29.049" end="01:29.688">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想将你独占</span></p><p begin="01:33.144" end="01:37.995" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:33.144" end="01:33.837">初</span><span begin="01:33.837" end="01:34.445">め</span><span begin="01:34.445" end="01:34.767">て</span><span begin="01:34.767" end="01:35.328">そう</span><span begin="01:35.328" end="01:35.795">思</span><span begin="01:35.795" end="01:36.722">えた</span><span begin="01:36.722" end="01:37.995">人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我第一次爱上的人</span></p><p begin="01:50.512" end="01:53.678" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:50.512" end="01:50.964">何</span><span begin="01:50.964" end="01:51.211">も</span><span begin="01:51.211" end="01:51.502">手</span><span begin="01:51.502" end="01:51.792">に</span><span begin="01:51.792" end="01:52.773">つか</span><span begin="01:52.773" end="01:53.226">ない</span><span begin="01:53.226" end="01:53.678">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任何事都静不下心</span></p><p begin="01:53.854" end="01:56.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:53.854" end="01:54.626">私</span><span begin="01:54.626" end="01:54.971">こ</span><span begin="01:54.971" end="01:55.254">ん</span><span begin="01:55.254" end="01:55.743">な</span><span begin="01:55.743" end="01:56.941">こと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还是初次有这种感觉</span></p><p begin="01:57.161" end="01:58.697" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:57.161" end="01:57.468">初</span><span begin="01:57.468" end="01:57.749">め</span><span begin="01:57.749" end="01:57.956">て</span><span begin="01:57.956" end="01:58.231">なん</span><span begin="01:58.231" end="01:58.697">だよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这般还是初次</span></p><p begin="01:58.971" end="02:00.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:58.971" end="01:59.437">特</span><span begin="01:59.437" end="01:59.850">別</span><span begin="01:59.850" end="02:00.050">なん</span><span begin="02:00.050" end="02:00.836">だよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对我来说非常特别</span></p><p begin="02:01.312" end="02:05.619" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:01.312" end="02:01.850">だ</span><span begin="02:01.850" end="02:02.340">から</span><span begin="02:02.340" end="02:02.598">手</span><span begin="02:02.598" end="02:03.265">放し</span><span begin="02:03.265" end="02:03.663">たく</span><span begin="02:03.894" end="02:04.542">ない</span><span begin="02:04.542" end="02:04.945">の</span><span begin="02:04.945" end="02:05.619">です</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我不愿放手</span></p><p begin="02:05.801" end="02:09.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:05.801" end="02:06.631">次</span><span begin="02:06.631" end="02:06.841">の</span><span begin="02:06.841" end="02:07.431">会</span><span begin="02:07.431" end="02:07.881">う</span><span begin="02:07.881" end="02:08.401">約束</span><span begin="02:08.401" end="02:08.921">だ</span><span begin="02:08.921" end="02:09.441">って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想立刻与你定下</span></p><p begin="02:09.591" end="02:12.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:09.591" end="02:09.897">す</span><span begin="02:09.897" end="02:10.324">ぐに</span><span begin="02:10.324" end="02:10.770">決め</span><span begin="02:10.770" end="02:11.183">た</span><span begin="02:11.183" end="02:11.806">い</span><span begin="02:11.806" end="02:12.360">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下次见面的约定</span></p><p begin="02:13.558" end="02:17.472" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:13.558" end="02:14.047">辛い</span><span begin="02:14.047" end="02:14.537">時</span><span begin="02:14.537" end="02:15.026">は</span><span begin="02:15.026" end="02:15.457">頼</span><span begin="02:15.457" end="02:15.918">って</span><span begin="02:15.918" end="02:16.260">ほ</span><span begin="02:16.260" end="02:16.983">しい</span><span begin="02:16.983" end="02:17.472">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难过时尽管来依靠我</span></p><p begin="02:17.712" end="02:20.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:17.712" end="02:18.214">後</span><span begin="02:18.214" end="02:18.593">悔</span><span begin="02:18.593" end="02:19.002">は</span><span begin="02:19.097" end="02:19.721">した</span><span begin="02:19.721" end="02:19.999">く</span><span begin="02:19.999" end="02:20.201">な</span><span begin="02:20.201" end="02:20.726">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不愿留下遗憾</span></p><p begin="02:21.478" end="02:25.891" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:21.478" end="02:22.361">泡</span><span begin="02:22.361" end="02:23.243">沫</span><span begin="02:23.243" end="02:23.626">の</span><span begin="02:23.626" end="02:24.341">夢</span><span begin="02:24.341" end="02:24.814">で</span><span begin="02:24.814" end="02:25.891">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使只是泡影一梦</span></p><p begin="02:29.076" end="02:37.178" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:29.076" end="02:29.413">あ</span><span begin="02:29.413" end="02:30.233">なた</span><span begin="02:30.233" end="02:30.912">に</span><span begin="02:30.912" end="02:31.391">出</span><span begin="02:31.391" end="02:31.970">会う</span><span begin="02:31.970" end="02:32.548">まで</span><span begin="02:32.548" end="02:32.849">は</span><span begin="02:32.849" end="02:33.706">諦</span><span begin="02:33.706" end="02:34.284">めて</span><span begin="02:34.284" end="02:34.863">ただ</span><span begin="02:34.863" end="02:35.442">目を</span><span begin="02:35.442" end="02:35.943">閉じ</span><span begin="02:35.943" end="02:36.378">て</span><span begin="02:36.378" end="02:37.178">いた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我放弃挣扎 阖上双眼</span></p><p begin="02:37.491" end="02:39.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:37.491" end="02:37.873">惹</span><span begin="02:37.873" end="02:38.276">か</span><span begin="02:38.276" end="02:38.505">れ</span><span begin="02:38.505" end="02:39.191">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为你倾心</span></p><p begin="02:39.145" end="02:40.372" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:39.145" end="02:39.860">初</span><span begin="02:39.860" end="02:39.963">め</span><span begin="02:39.963" end="02:40.372">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我第一次许下心愿</span></p><p begin="02:40.375" end="02:43.865" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:40.375" end="02:41.073">望</span><span begin="02:41.073" end="02:41.700">んで</span><span begin="02:41.700" end="02:42.269">し</span><span begin="02:42.269" end="02:42.469">ま</span><span begin="02:42.469" end="02:43.167">った</span><span begin="02:43.167" end="02:43.865">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不断期望能够拥有</span></p><p begin="02:44.195" end="02:51.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:44.195" end="02:44.561">あ</span><span begin="02:44.561" end="02:44.972">なた</span><span begin="02:44.972" end="02:45.965">との</span><span begin="02:47.160" end="02:47.732">幸</span><span begin="02:47.732" end="02:48.137">せ</span><span begin="02:48.137" end="02:51.794">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">祈愿与你的幸福</span></p><p begin="03:06.793" end="03:08.753" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="03:06.793" end="03:07.307">いつ</span><span begin="03:07.307" end="03:07.554">消</span><span begin="03:07.554" end="03:08.216">え</span><span begin="03:08.216" end="03:08.753">ても</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">本以为无论何时消失</span></p><p begin="03:08.753" end="03:10.674" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="03:08.753" end="03:09.793">失</span><span begin="03:09.793" end="03:10.034">って</span><span begin="03:10.034" end="03:10.674">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">何时失去</span></p><p begin="03:10.674" end="03:14.726" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="03:10.674" end="03:11.228">いい</span><span begin="03:11.228" end="03:11.527">と</span><span begin="03:11.527" end="03:12.340">思</span><span begin="03:12.340" end="03:13.022">って</span><span begin="03:13.022" end="03:13.852">いた</span><span begin="03:13.852" end="03:14.726">のに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">何时失去 都无关紧要</span></p><p begin="03:14.935" end="03:16.991" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="03:14.935" end="03:15.248">あ</span><span begin="03:15.248" end="03:15.687">なた</span><span begin="03:15.687" end="03:15.915">だ</span><span begin="03:15.915" end="03:16.294">け</span><span begin="03:16.294" end="03:16.991">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可只有你 只有这段共度的时光</span></p><p begin="03:16.964" end="03:18.979" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="03:16.964" end="03:17.367">時</span><span begin="03:17.367" end="03:17.770">間</span><span begin="03:17.770" end="03:18.003">だ</span><span begin="03:18.003" end="03:18.248">け</span><span begin="03:18.248" end="03:18.979">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有时间是</span></p><p begin="03:18.825" end="03:22.619" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="03:18.825" end="03:19.340">ず</span><span begin="03:19.340" end="03:19.594">っと</span><span begin="03:19.594" end="03:20.305">続い</span><span begin="03:20.305" end="03:20.541">て</span><span begin="03:20.541" end="03:21.137">欲し</span><span begin="03:21.137" end="03:22.619">いと</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望得以成为永恒</span></p><p begin="03:22.870" end="03:26.236" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="03:22.870" end="03:23.685">思え</span><span begin="03:23.685" end="03:24.065">た</span><span begin="03:24.065" end="03:24.661">か</span><span begin="03:24.661" end="03:26.236">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">的这般念想</span></p><p begin="03:26.595" end="03:32.846" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="03:26.595" end="03:27.581">ず</span><span begin="03:27.581" end="03:27.984">っと</span><span begin="03:27.984" end="03:28.679">ここ</span><span begin="03:28.679" end="03:29.373">に</span><span begin="03:29.373" end="03:30.002">い</span><span begin="03:30.002" end="03:30.301">ても</span><span begin="03:30.301" end="03:31.193">いい</span><span begin="03:31.193" end="03:32.151">です</span><span begin="03:32.151" end="03:32.846">か？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可以一直陪伴在你身边吗？</span></p><p begin="03:33.165" end="03:39.019" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="03:33.165" end="03:33.620">あな</span><span begin="03:33.620" end="03:33.854">た</span><span begin="03:33.854" end="03:34.293">の</span><span begin="03:34.293" end="03:34.903">そ</span><span begin="03:34.903" end="03:35.244">ば</span><span begin="03:35.244" end="03:35.839">に</span><span begin="03:35.839" end="03:36.321">居</span><span begin="03:36.321" end="03:36.802">た</span><span begin="03:36.802" end="03:37.299">い</span><span begin="03:37.299" end="03:37.758">か</span><span begin="03:37.758" end="03:39.019">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我好想留在你身边</span></p><p begin="03:42.055" end="03:48.199" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="03:42.055" end="03:43.143">貴方</span><span begin="03:43.143" end="03:44.084">の</span><span begin="03:44.084" end="03:45.054">隣</span><span begin="03:45.054" end="03:45.428">が</span><span begin="03:45.428" end="03:45.906">似</span><span begin="03:45.906" end="03:46.357">合</span><span begin="03:46.357" end="03:46.699">う</span><span begin="03:46.699" end="03:47.516">よう</span><span begin="03:47.516" end="03:48.199">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会努力成为在你身旁</span></p><p begin="03:48.495" end="03:51.723" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="03:48.495" end="03:49.033">頑</span><span begin="03:49.033" end="03:49.571">張</span><span begin="03:49.571" end="03:49.857">る</span><span begin="03:49.857" end="03:50.047">か</span><span begin="03:50.047" end="03:50.147">ら</span><span begin="03:50.147" end="03:51.723">私</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与你相衬的人</span></p><p begin="03:54.281" end="03:59.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="03:54.281" end="03:54.974">初</span><span begin="03:54.974" end="03:55.582">め</span><span begin="03:55.582" end="03:55.904">て</span><span begin="03:55.904" end="03:56.465">そう</span><span begin="03:56.465" end="03:56.932">思</span><span begin="03:56.932" end="03:57.859">えた</span><span begin="03:57.859" end="03:59.132">人</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我第一次爱上的人</span></p></div></body></tt>